# The sheep pen: a round wooden fence (two rails and posts all round, a gap
# for a gate at the front, facing +z) round a dirt floor. Blocky, like a
# real fence. Its centre is x = z = 18 (index 17.5).
size 36 8 36
voxel 0.075
colors
  d penDirt
  w wood
  b woodDark
# The floor.
ellipsoid 17.5 0 17.5 16.5 0.5 16.5 d
# Two rails, each a ring (a disc with its middle cleared).
ellipsoid 17.5 2 17.5 17.5 0.5 17.5 w
ellipsoid 17.5 2 17.5 16.3 0.5 16.3 .
ellipsoid 17.5 5 17.5 17.5 0.5 17.5 w
ellipsoid 17.5 5 17.5 16.3 0.5 16.3 .
# Floor back in (the clearing took the middle out of the rail rings only).
ellipsoid 17.5 0 17.5 16.5 0.5 16.5 d
# The gate gap at the front.
box 14 1 31 21 7 35 .
# Posts all round (and either side of the gate).
box 23 0 33 24 6 34 b
box 29 0 29 30 6 30 b
box 33 0 23 34 6 24 b
box 34 0 17 35 6 18 b
box 33 0 11 34 6 12 b
box 29 0 5 30 6 6 b
box 23 0 1 24 6 2 b
box 17 0 0 18 6 1 b
box 11 0 1 12 6 2 b
box 5 0 5 6 6 6 b
box 1 0 11 2 6 12 b
box 0 0 17 1 6 18 b
box 1 0 23 2 6 24 b
box 5 0 29 6 6 30 b
box 11 0 33 12 6 34 b
box 13 0 33 14 7 34 b
box 21 0 33 22 7 34 b
